{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028195338054-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028200209\"/><p>部分被捕女子。</p><p>執法部門聯同相關部門人員根據線報及經深入調查後，今日(28日)下午展開打擊非法賣淫的行動。行動中，人員分別於大埔同茂坊、大埔大榮里、上水新發街及粉嶺聯發街的唐樓單位拘捕12名內地女子，年齡介乎26至52歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人士現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:41:22.078999+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:53:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.277223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:27.559514+00:00","content_hash":"afd317e7602117f6f45c033918bed0a4ad7521cf2bba568445482b6567983a3f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:41:22.078999+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}